    "literal_objects": [
      "Symmetric matrices are a transpose-fixed submodule of EuclideanSpace R (D\u00d7D).",
      "Frobenius norm is actual entry flattening; spectral norm is the actual Euclidean matrix CLM operator norm.",
      "M_A is literally (transpose A * H * A - H,trace H), with actual Euclidean product target.",
      "The least singular bound is derived from actual ordered singularValues and the complete right singular head.",
      "The trace component cancels in the derived perturbation bound.",
      "Both centers use actual nonsingular matrix inverse formulas; their equations are derived from invertibility."
